-# The house's thank-you sentence, for donation and pass copy on public pages
-# and in email. Renders inline text with no wrapper: callers put it inside
-# their own paragraph. Pass phone_phrase: to change how the phone sentence
-# is worded (the membership email says "call us at").
-#
-# Houses generally want to say something particular here — about the artists
-# the money pays, or the neighbourhood — so this is a leaf partial meant to be
-# overridden at sites/<slug>/views/shared/_house_thanks_line.html.haml.
= "Thank you for supporting #{theater_info.name}."
- if theater_info.phone.present?
  = "If you have any questions, please #{local_assigns.fetch(:phone_phrase, 'call our box office at')} #{theater_info.phone}."
